<title>USA: Conrail Oct intermodal volume rises.</title>
<headline>Conrail Oct intermodal volume rises.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>In October, Conrail said it set a new record for intermodal volume shipped over its system, transporting 162,600 trailers and containers.</p>
<p>That's an 8.1 percent increase over the previous record of 150,400 set in October 1994, the company said.</p>
<p>For the first 10 months of 1996, Conrail said it shipped a total of 1,320,000 intermodal trailers and containers, an increase of 5.1 percent over the same period of 1995.</p>
